
title: Portal
---
<<declare $foundTeleporterEnergy = false>>
<<declare $portalInteracted = false>>
<<declare $portalEnergyQuestStarted = false>>
<<declare $portalEnergyQuestComplete = false>>
<<declare $portalActivated = false>>

<<if $portalActivated == true>>
    Portal: The portal hums with a steady flow of energy.
    Portal: Its surface shimmers, revealing a mysterious path beyond.
    {$playerName}: The portal is still working.
    {$playerName}: This might finally be our way out.
    -> Enter the portal
        {$playerName}: Here goes nothing.
        Portal: Teleporting Soon...
    -> Leave it for now
        {$playerName}: I should make sure I'm ready before going through.
<<elseif $foundTeleporterEnergy == true>>
    Portal: The mysterious portal begins to glow as you approach.
    Portal: The Teleporter Energy resonates with the portal.
    {$playerName}: Looks like this is what I needed to activate it.
    -> Activate the portal
        {$playerName}: Let's see if this works.
        Portal: You place the Teleporter Energy into the portal.
        Portal: A powerful light spreads across its surface.
        Portal: The portal has been activated!
        <<set $portalActivated = true>>
        <<if $portalEnergyQuestStarted == true && $portalEnergyQuestComplete == false>>
            <<set $portalEnergyQuestComplete = true>>
            <<complete_quest QuestManager "portal_energy">>
        <<endif>>
        {$playerName}: Finally, a way out of here.
        Portal: The portal is now ready to use.
    -> Leave it for now
        {$playerName}: I should make sure I'm ready first.
<<elseif $portalInteracted == false>>
    Portal: A mysterious portal stands before you.
    Portal: Strange energy flows through it, almost as though it's connected to somewhere else.
    {$playerName}: Could this be a way out of here?
    Portal: You examine the portal more closely.
    Portal: The portal appears to be missing an energy source.
    {$playerName}: Maybe I should look around for something that can power it.
    <<set $portalInteracted = true>>
    <<set $foundTeleporter = true>>
    -> Search for an energy source
        {$playerName}: There must be something nearby that can activate this.
        <<set $portalEnergyQuestStarted = true>>
        <<start_quest QuestManager "portal_energy">>
        Portal: New Quest - The Missing Energy
        {$playerName}: I'll search the surrounding area.
    -> Leave the portal
        {$playerName}: I'll come back when I know more.
<<else>>
    Portal: The mysterious portal continues to glow faintly.
    {$playerName}: I still need to find the Teleporter Energy to activate this.
    Portal: Perhaps I should explore the surrounding area.
    <<if $portalEnergyQuestStarted == false>>
        -> Search for an energy source
            {$playerName}: I should find something that can power this portal.
            <<set $portalEnergyQuestStarted = true>>
            <<start_quest QuestManager "portal_energy">>
            Portal: New Quest - The Missing Energy
    <<endif>>
    -> Leave
        {$playerName}: I'll return once I've found what I need.
<<endif>>
===